      "comment": "ZIPPING JAKARA (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Gunnedah in a handy 30.61 beating Aston Hurn. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Can measure up again. NANGAR CHICK (8) recorded a win over 515m at this track in a convincing 29.51 last start. In form and looks a leading player again. ZIPPING SWOOPES (3) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with her maiden win, then finished a 12 length fourth last start at this track over 515m (30.38). Back to track where she won her maiden. Can improve sharply here. HOT TO TRACE (2) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - in the mix again.",
